  {
   "key": "func RouteTRIMPEstimator.estimate(_:savedRouteStore:priors:)",
   "hash": "85dc849080437d93",
   "does": "Matches the track to a saved route, takes the prior runs `priors` gives for the route and the workout's start, their TRIMP/metre (outliers removed), compares to today's recorded TRIMP/metre and returns nil when today's ratio >= 70 % of the prior average; with no priors, also returns nil when the target distance is the recorded distance; otherwise returns the blended/prior/today-scaled estimate scaled to the target distance.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/RouteLibrary.swift::func RouteLibrary.findMatch(currentTrack:sport:store:)",
    "closure:priors",
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/RouteTRIMPEstimator.swift::var RouteTRIMPEstimator.PriorRun.trimpPerMetre",
